\":\\\"CONFIRMED\\\"\"))\n+    }\n+\n+    @Test\n+    fun `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment with error code`() {\n+        mockMvc.perform(createShipment(\"S-6\")).andExpect(status().isCreated)\n+\n+        repository.save(\n+            repository.findById(\"S-6\")!!.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED),\n+        )\n+\n+        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-6/confirm\"))\n+            .andExpect(status().isConflict)\n+            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_CANCELLED\"))\n+\n+        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-6\"))\n+            .andExpect(status().isOk)\n+            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.status\").value(\"CANCELLED\"))\n+    }\n+\n+    @Test\n+    fun `rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with error code`() {\n+        mockMvc.perform(post(\"/shipments/S-missing/confirm\"))\n+            .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n+            .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.error.code\").value(\"SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\"))\n+\n+        mockMvc.perform(get(\"/shipments/S-missing\"))\n+            .andExpect(status().isNotFound)\n+    }\n }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f2891a7-31c8-4d08-83d4-b31f28ea570c","uuid":"b632c42e-b87d-403a-a92b-8615e4447f00","timestamp":"2026-09-09T16:40:51.257Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"diff --git a/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt b/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt\nindex 64986b7..781c891 100644\n--- a/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt\n+++ b/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt\n@@ -81,4 +81,63 @@ class ShipmentControllerTest {\n             .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[0].shipmentId\").value(\"S-a\"))\n             .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$[1].shipmentId\").value(\"S-b\"))\n     }\n+\n+    @Test\n+    fun `confirms a created shipment and persists the cha